00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:03,280
And that's it.

527
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:04,640
That's the end of your relationship.

528
00:37:05,040 --> 00:37:09,840
And so I think a lot of the brands like that are saying, how do I extend my relationship with my consumer?

529
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:17,360
And so we saw this with Pinkbike, which is a company we sold last year where they had three legs to the stool.

530
00:37:17,920 --> 00:37:20,080
And so the first piece of the stool was just content, right?

