00:37:24,640 --> 00:37:30,320
And you're going to see that happen across a variety of platforms now where they're and they monetize through ads, simple, super simple.

533
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:37,440
But that was really a content engine to pull people into the other key piece of the business, which is one consumer subscription business called Trailforks.

534
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:41,280
And then a second one, which was a marketplace where they could buy and sell mountain bikes.

535
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:48,000
And so I think brands that are fascinated, they have like a really powerful position in food, in entertainment, in services.

536
00:37:48,720 --> 00:37:52,640
They're going to want to monetize their customer in more ways than just one transaction.

537
00:37:53,200 --> 00:37:59,840
And so a consumer subscription element of that enables you to have a constant dialogue with your consumer and also get feedback from them.

538
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:00,640
What do they care about?

539
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:01,440
What do they want to have?

540
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:02,560
What do they want to learn about?

