00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:40,880
Well, in an ATT world, what's the perfect way to advertise your fishing lure at Bass Pro Shop in a way that you can track end to end and understand the consumer behavior and what ads are resonating?

544
00:38:41,760 --> 00:39:08,400
And so I think there are a lot of opportunities for these physical goods marketplaces to acquire a consumer subscription business in this space and then be able to get those end to end conversions and have a much so like if Bass Pro Shop is advertising in their own app, they're going to have a much higher return on ads than the app could have done just putting Google Ads in there.

